<!--
  Capacitor's template shared the whole of external storage and the cache dir
  through the FileProvider. No plugin is installed (capacitor.plugins.json is
  empty), so nothing ever asks for a content:// URI — the grants were unused
  surface. Left empty rather than removing the provider, so adding a plugin
  later is a matter of declaring exactly the path it needs.
-->
